            "review_title": "Review at Radio Dublin Irish Pub",
            "review_text": "Christian T\n1 contribution\n0\nNice & friendly staff - but cash only\nJul 2023\nThe staff are nice, helpful and present.\n\nHowever, I was not made aware of that it only was possible to pay with cash before the payment has to fall, which is just impractical and costly in fees at the ATM. In my case, I ended up paying at the neighboring bar, because the fee at the ATM almost exceeded the price of what I had bought. I ended up having to pay an extra fee for that too.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 16, 2023",
